## What NOT to build (Phase 1)

- ❌ ERP systems
- ❌ Complex automation pipelines
- ❌ Enterprise collaboration features
- ❌ Heavy dashboards
- ❌ Auto-generate full hồ sơ
- ❌ Crawler/scraper phức tạp

Focus: **20% effort → 80% value**
